# The Moonlit Path (windurst 9): the Dark Mana Orb's nation half alone. A Windurst char at Windurst rank 10 with The
# Promise completed (each other operand of the orb met) changes its nation to Bastok at Mythily in Metalworks: her 360
# (no current nation mission, mission status 0), option 1: setNation(Bastok), the fee taken (gil=40000 covers any
# GetNationRank fee), rank points 0; char_profile keeps the Windurst rank 10. The new-char cutscene's
# HQuest[newCharacterCS]nations has the Bastok bit (2, by GM), so her finish returns before its random setPos. Back at
# Leepe-Hoppe, the turn-in 846 (mask 192), option 6: 15000 gil, completed, no Dark Mana Orb (a Bastok char at Windurst
# rank 10 with The Promise: only the nation half is false).
lists WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/846
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=11.4,-9.75,-195.97 nation=2 gil=40000
rank 10
fame Windurst 425
quest Windurst.TheMoonlitPath accepted
quest Windurst.ThePromise completed
keyitem WhisperOfTheMoon
charvar HQuest[newCharacterCS]nations 2
login
warp 94,-20,-8 Metalworks
trigger Mythily                         # 360 (0, wasCitizen 1, Bastok rank 1, nation 1, hasGil 1, the fee)
finish option=1                         # setNation(1), the fee taken, rank points 0; the Bastok bit set: no setPos
warp 11.4,-9.75,-195.97 WindurstWaters
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # 846 (mask 192)
finish option=6                         # 15000 gil; completed; Bastok at Windurst rank 10 with The Promise: no orb
